167
00:14:14.929 --> 00:14:17.379
Pärast anname ära.

168
00:14:21.440 --> 00:14:22.900
Tulema saada.

169
00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:24.550
Mul on.

170
00:14:24.650 --> 00:14:27.075
Paar asja on ära.

171
00:14:28.250 --> 00:14:31.150
Aga lähme siis meile,
siis on see praegu suitsuma.

172
00:14:31.250 --> 00:14:35.090
See siia sobib üks väga-väga hea
asi.

173
00:14:35.190 --> 00:14:37.070
Üks.

174
00:14:37.170 --> 00:14:38.330
Üks silt.

175
00:14:38.430 --> 00:14:41.030
Nii nii.

176
00:14:41.130 --> 00:14:43.780
Panus on silmaga näha. No.

177
00:14:45.970 --> 00:14:48.510
Mis te sellest arvate?

178
00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:54.580
Nimekoma viis, see on 300-st pronks
pronksilehtterasest saetud välja,

179
00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:55.530
nii

180
00:14:55.630 --> 00:14:57.930
juhilise aega,
nii et kolm tundi läks see

181
00:14:58.030 --> 00:15:00.505
